4
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:46,000
Tabloid is a 2010 American documentary film directed by Errol Morris.

5
00:48:20,000 --> 00:48:26,000
It tells the story of Joyce McKinney, who was accused of kidnapping and raping
Kirk Anderson, an American Mormon missionary in England, in 1977.

6
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
The incident, known as the Mormon sex in chains case, became a major tabloid story in the United Kingdom and triggered
a circulation battle between two popular tabloid newspapers, the Daily Express and the Daily Mirror.

7
01:07:40,000 --> 01:07:46,000
For the film, Morris interviewed McKinney, former Daily Express journalist Peter Tory
(1939-2012), and Daily Mirror photographer Kent Gavin, among others.

8
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
The film makes reference to various aspects of
Mormon culture, such as temple garments.
